# Enforce LF line endings for generated tab-separated data (e.g. the Index
# Verborum artifacts). This backstops the explicit lineterminator="\n" writer
# conventions and the LF-ending tests so TSVs are stored with LF regardless of
# platform or how they are regenerated.
# Trailing-space whitespace warnings are suppressed for TSVs because empty
# trailing columns legitimately produce trailing tab characters.
*.tsv text eol=lf whitespace=-trailing-space
